      "descriptionHash": "1b3f231bcc448cf1caac5bc0467aeb98512e0a154815748bc772c28327372e58",
      "description": "登录；list_my_conversations/start_conversation取conversationId，须确认收件人/全文，再以本人身份真发文字。",
