      "descriptionHash": "7064e97d17d33d4b82361468e671f4461f609a87f3c3b0327ab394d0a3042848",
      "description": "登录；确认会话/对象后真发服务生成主页/需求卡，禁自拼卡/链接。list_my_conversations/get_need→确认→send_share_card→read_messages核对。",
      "labels": [
        "public-sink"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "get_contact_exchange_state",
      "descriptionHash": "d09f88a066eeada4f0d5e0705d77d7e3f67467a0da446417a6e428bca45b3fd9",
      "description": "登录；真人DM交换状态/myContacts/canRequest；ACCEPTED当时快照。可请求→确认→request_contact_exchange；peerPending→确认→respond_contact_exchange；无联系add_profile_link。",
      "labels": [
        "untrusted-content",
        "private-data"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "request_contact_exchange",
      "descriptionHash": "ffd297c67a8b4a404df256f5c2d7a092a9406da60532b57823bb0b90a07f6ddf",
      "description": "登录；真人DM真实交换请求，须确认且本人≥1联系，无则no_contact_info→add_profile_link。同意冻结当时快照。本人重复幂等；already_exchanged禁重试，peer_request_pending用respond_contact_exchange。get_contact_exchange_state→确认→请求。",
      "labels": [
        "private-data"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "respond_contact_exchange",
      "descriptionHash": "8da0cdfcc0ad8c64222d32af93ef4a4bc618086f99cc77ff76a325f0f0a578b6",
      "description": "登录；回应真人DM待处理请求；accept=true披露当时联系快照，须确认且本人≥1联系。reject后可再发，重复幂等。get_contact_exchange_state→确认→respond。",
      "labels": [
        "private-data"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "list_my_activities",
      "descriptionHash": "7d084041a2146a2efe5637f7f7819065accbad2c4f5ae47aedae13de2dc22a71",
      "description": "登录;列本人可管理活动，含报名总数/待审数/角色/报名配置。默认未归档，archived=true查取消/下架，q先按标题筛。slug→get_organizer_activity，pendingCount>0→list_signup_submissions。读归档不恢复或改历史。"
    },
    {
      "name": "update_activity",
      "descriptionHash": "2bf993ecfeb8806b2a31e587a888966d5bc271a37ae65b61778a2fa8450f5002",
      "description": "登录；确认后立即改本人活动标题/正文/时间/图片；slug/type不可改，报名表另调。提前截止废止在填草稿，须确认影响。list_my_activities→确认→update_activity→get_activity。"
    },
    {
      "name": "cancel_activity",
      "descriptionHash": "dadb79ad43c7ff5b10df7fbf2bfadda00846ab067491058db05af7b82135eed5",
      "description": "登录；取消本人活动，已取消/结束不可再取消。"
    },
    {
      "name": "create_product",
      "descriptionHash": "a0a558893938be2f364eb695399a26a3bf56f75e9b96ddaa728224854e09e832",
      "description": "登录；建产品/作品立即公开、后审。slug缺省按名生成，占用自动派生；update_my_product补链接/媒体/标签。"
    },
    {
      "name": "set_product_status",
      "descriptionHash": "5f2ffb520660e829c5116ff985edda5da28f910559e9d35d73cb9273645504ef",
      "description": "登录；本人产品仅PUBLISHED⇄ARCHIVED互切，其余系统管理。get_my_products取id/status。"
    },
    {
      "name": "claim_product",
      "descriptionHash": "d3e0c013a2021464e558c27216e60b640881437d2e214e44d282c29ee81e8c69",
      "description": "登录；凭管理员认领码认领预录产品到本人，立即发布、后审。"
    },
    {
