      "descriptionHash": "b22ab2fdbce444fa8fb90d1e7e6a2daefd3520ddebb5965e0b87a06da4921e81",
      "description": "登录；确认角色再改；personas全替换，省略缩为一个，先get_my_profile保留多角色。OTHER须personaOther，仅FOUNDER处理creatorType。→get_onboarding_status→补缺→complete_onboarding。"
    },
    {
