    },
    {
      "name": "create_company",
      "descriptionHash": "78869561829a8b5c811546cde2d38892472d46bbbce5c29af54440d8372af7fd",
      "description": "登录；确认后建/更新本人公司，一人一家、立即公开/异步处理；slug_taken换slug。get_my_profile→确认→create_company→complete_onboarding。"
    },
    {
      "name": "update_my_company",
      "descriptionHash": "bf21acf24c49fb55075106c654d80f85a9a997e7bd2b2bb4a15411021b840d8a",
      "description": "登录；改本人公司，省略保留，无公司须slug/name；先get_my_company，slug_taken换slug。立即PUBLISHED，含归档重新发布，后台风控；下架/删用专用工具。"
    },
    {
      "name": "get_onboarding_status",
      "descriptionHash": "0d88a4661ac59a66f03d4e67fc98549ac50000d726f7a40124e500c3e56aa501",
      "description": "登录；入驻缺项/历史报名prefill；bio满足资料条件、intro可选。预填逐项确认，禁跳必填。set_persona→create_product(创始人)→update_my_profile(canOffer)→create_company(可选)→complete_onboarding；completed防重。"
    },
    {
      "name": "complete_onboarding",
      "descriptionHash": "eb9e4f948b4badffa8e44b5746422bd253859ec343fb16cab35686fe352b4d56",
      "description": "登录；确认完成入驻并记时间；校验persona，FOUNDER须产品/bio、intro可选。不全先补勿盲重试。get_onboarding_status→补缺→确认→complete_onboarding。"
    },
    {
