      "descriptionHash": "7d287fe8340ca707ecb58c8fe2e38d0100e431f17276e2e3ee9b0898aeb95ad5",
      "description": "登录；镜像公开HTTP(S)图片，验大小/格式/SSRF/安全。avatar二维码/联系拒绝须换图，禁重试同图；moment-image仅JPEG/PNG/WebP。URL再写对象；组织logo用fetch_organization_logo，禁假URL。",
      "labels": [
        "public-sink"
      ]
    },
