      "descriptionHash": "e32d62fc9dd6eb0ac1db94ee40712ddc3ded558703ff8979cfb405b0bb96ee67",
      "description": "登录；确认后全替兴趣/描述及embedding，影响feed非匹配/推送。get_my_profile→确认→set；匹配set_my_match_preference。"
    },
    {
      "name": "list_my_devices",
      "descriptionHash": "189fe31edcb4291ff6dd33ab32ac5c1436f566b52fe66de57fe40d33ccbeebf5",
      "description": "登录；本人agent/CLI设备：名称/客户端/token末6位/创建/使用/过期/吊销时间；revoke_my_device吊销。",
      "labels": [
        "private-data"
      ]
    },
