      "name": "revoke_my_device",
      "descriptionHash": "3ca427f8d880ba18227dbd5bc0216edecc400dc2027601100eae8ac8120273e7",
      "description": "登录；list_my_devices取deviceId吊销本人设备，token立即失效；revoked示是否实际吊销。",
      "labels": [
        "private-data"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "get_relationship",
      "descriptionHash": "bcaec50aec887913b52176fd8a72937ceae1a802594899cc1855cf44b33d1ec1",
      "description": "登录；following我关注TA/followedBy反向/isFriend互关/isSelf本人；好友可见好友链接。"
    },
    {
      "name": "get_conversation",
      "descriptionHash": "2209c5231da1e0d98945cf4e28d23fcb139f9842c9d37b375a8e4f9627771f66",
      "description": "登录；本人会话/成员产品/已读位置/静音/群破冰说明，正文read_messages。停未来破冰snooze/icebreak=false，当前群另退。list_my_conversations→详情→read_messages/send_message。"
    },
    {
      "name": "check_activity_eligibility",
      "descriptionHash": "bd43d01f85a27fb4048da96e70411d8ab94b45aa926d1da48b37128e4f3d9cdc",
      "description": "登录；办活动资格：主理人bio/intro≥10字且发布产品；主办方入驻及机构/联系人/手机/介绍完整。profile_incomplete补入驻，organizer_profile_required须App短信验证、MCP禁写，no_published_product先create_product。→create_organizer_activity。"
    },
    {
      "name": "claim_creator_by_token",
      "descriptionHash": "e4ec7965d524519da2b5a11ae81ead501d9386304e0dcbb7602300b94da2321f",
      "description": "登录；须确认身份/token来源，凭邮件ct token不可逆认领整份占位资料/产品/会话，非单产品码。ok=false按invalid/not_found/claimed/self处理勿重试。→认领→get_my_card。",
      "labels": [
        "private-data"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "create_need",
      "descriptionHash": "3c5650e8a3a1560cfbf26a2aea7702f1f0cde7f949afd97621e2b46a5d5eb215",
      "description": "登录；须确认title/detail后发真实公开需求，异步匹配/推送。标题3~120字写具体；contextType/contextId成对且本人对象，图先镜像。→get_need_recommendations→get_creator/contact_need；改update_need。"
    },
    {
      "name": "update_need",
      "descriptionHash": "9ec86e08457d871f823751828c5adb590b0f49e77b62ff8cbf6fa6fab1854e59",
      "description": "登录；确认后patch本人OPEN需求，403非本人/409关闭勿重试；认领完成不改需求状态。list_my_needs→确认→update_need→get_need。"
    },
    {
      "name": "unpublish_need",
      "descriptionHash": "b63388c945ee9d712ee86215ad08ce039b6ae2a31219259cd579b55d4853886b",
      "description": "登录；本人需求可逆下架，状态/接洽不变、不删；接洽/时间不自动下架。reopen_need免费反复恢复。403 not_your_need，取消/完成409 need_closed。"
    },
    {
      "name": "reopen_need",
      "descriptionHash": "d91a6cc067c07bf4e5d0f70cf9d635c8808316d9820483d9d7652c5543bdeafc",
      "description": "登录；免费反复恢复本人手动下架需求，配unpublish_need。403 not_your_need；取消/完成409 need_closed须create_need另发。"
    },
    {
      "name": "cancel_need",
      "descriptionHash": "debe2a275bcad898d28e682fc5e7f270a70b3f13a04553b493d1016495886085",
      "description": "登录；取消本人需求为终态，禁编辑/重开；临时用unpublish_need。403 not_your_need，完成409 need_already_completed，已取消409 need_closed。"
    },
    {
      "name": "delete_need",
      "descriptionHash": "58d149f504e1423fe859fc821f8749aad392bd4e43b7fc321fdcebdf0e319c0d",
      "description": "登录；确认后硬删本人需求/全部接洽，不可恢复。cancel_need留记录、unpublish_need可逆。403 not_your_need。",
      "labels": [
        "destructive"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "contact_need",
      "descriptionHash": "bf3458d393d64457eae67e3fbd92ac06b6e4fc5712898ad4ea0544cf2428a17f",
      "description": "登录；确认在架需求对象/可选message≤2000字后真实开聊认领/发送；无名额限制。认领幂等、message每次真发。本人400/不存在404/关闭409/额度429禁重试。get_need→contact_need→get_conversation_needs/send_message→双方complete_need。",
      "labels": [
        "private-data"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "complete_need",
      "descriptionHash": "3f7eab8f04632cff7e32add8dc2e517530842b50f67ee000b7585d284d54fe53",
      "description": "登录；仅认领会话确认本人实际完成，作者/认领人均确认才完成，看authorDone/claimerDone。403非参与者、409无认领/完成/关闭禁重试。get_conversation_needs→确认→complete_need。"
    },
    {
      "name": "list_my_needs",
      "descriptionHash": "62cec97a8df865fa8f62379a6c75e3bc54e97c96a79956f792609c356026b444",
      "description": "登录；本人需求含取消历史；displaying才在架，OPEN非展示。认领完成非整需完成，查get_conversation_needs。id→update_need/unpublish_need；displaying=true仅在架，推荐get_need_recommendations。"
    },
    {
      "name": "get_need_recommendations",
      "descriptionHash": "ae32b978eeb03cd8557b2e20ff756a424931f26974cc909887ba8fb382ece01a",
      "description": "登录/本人需求；not_your_need禁重试。匹配分/理由/作者需求，cursor带已看id勿刷首页。list_my_needs→推荐→get_creator→start_conversation/contact_need。"
    },
    {
      "name": "get_conversation_needs",
      "descriptionHash": "2ddfcf962d1f17d91487e66010d2ebe321f02f5686e908dfbd010a67cf5ab59d",
      "description": "登录；本人会话认领/双方完成态，无绑定null；peerOpenNeeds≤10，空非无需求。list_my_conversations→本工具→send_message/complete_need。"
    },
    {
      "name": "get_share_card_manifest",
      "descriptionHash": "18ee9582843ae9ff7759c30742a4449dbbce0e407b7744f214c52a7b307f8a6b",
